EasyCrypt
---------

The `*.expected.json` fixtures under `CatCrypt/Crypto/EasyCryptImport/` are the
output of `ec2json`, a separate exporter that links `easycrypt.ecLib` and reads
EasyCrypt's own typed AST. They therefore carry EasyCrypt names — prelude
operator paths such as `Top.Pervasive.bool` and `Top.DBool.dbool`, type
constructor paths, and identifier uniqueness stamps. No EasyCrypt source is
copied or modified here, and the exporter is not part of this repository.

